      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Kwalifikacja leadów\n\n**Trigger:** Webhook — podepnij formularz strony (np. STFS booking) lub CRM.\n\n**Do zrobienia:**\n1. Podmień węzeł AI na swój provider (OpenAI/Claude) + klucz API.\n2. W węźle \"Zapisz do CRM\" podmień URL na endpoint Twojego CRM (HubSpot/Pipedrive/inny) + auth.\n3. Ustaw próg scoringu w węźle IF.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "6d9f8ed5-f20a-44d2-a547-d70d3564f9ac",
      "name": "Nowy lead (Webhook)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        80,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "lead-nowy",
        "authentication": "headerAuth",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "0a4f143d-24f0-48bd-985c-c39a4b6ec040",
      "name": "AI: oceń i przypisz score",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        340,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "notes": "Wysyła treść zapytania do modelu, który zwraca score 0-100 i kategorię leada."
    },
    {
      "id": "d054dcbe-3bab-4102-ae8f-23527e427134",
      "name": "Wyciągnij score",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        600,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const score = $json.score ?? 50;\nreturn [{ json: { ...$json, score } }];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ac886ba4-9521-4fd7-a368-1e6fe895a2a2",
      "name": "Czy lead gorący?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        860,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "85856254-0ed0-4495-a00a-619805cdfcbc",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.score }}",
              "rightValue": 70,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "gte"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "7681a132-ed85-4a91-a118-4ad1a4c14cc7",
